  "description": "Fuselage: White upper fuselage, dark teal lower fuselage and belly; faint pale zigzag bands on the white behind the wing. Cheatlines: A red pinstripe at the white/teal split, from the nose tip to under the tail cone. Tail: Teal fin with darker-teal horizontal zigzag bands and the America West mark (a big red disc with a red, white-edged 'W'). Engines: Teal cowlings with red inlet lips and an outlined W. Winglets: Teal fences with the red W. Titles: American's 'American' and flight symbol forward. Artwork: none. Colors hex: matched by eye from one photo.",
